  "title": "NFS: Limit number of ops dissected.",
  "description": "Avoid allocating huge amounts of memory when a packet contains too many NFSv4\noperations.  There were already checks in two of the four locations where we\ndissect lists of operations; This change adds identical checks in the two other\nlocations.\n\n----\n\nMinimal test case: [ultimate-trimmed.pcapng.gz](/uploads/a43ec20cc16ab4b413a8ba874279bc9a/ultimate-trimmed.pcapng.gz)\n\nMinimal test case generated from ```editcap -r ultimate_wireshark_protocols_pcap_220213.pcap /tmp/ultimate-trimmed.pcapng 223731-223731```.\n\nWithout this change, Valgrind warns about very large memory allocations:\n\n```\n$ valgrind -- ../wireshark-ninja-gcc-debug/run/tshark -nr /tmp/ultimate-trimmed.pcapng.gz \n==683676== Memcheck, a memory error detector\n==683676== Copyright (C) 2002-2022, and GNU GPL'd, by Julian Seward et al.\n==683676== Using Valgrind-3.19.0 and LibVEX; rerun with -h for copyright info\n==683676== Command: ../wireshark-ninja-gcc-debug/run/tshark -nr /tmp/ultimate-trimmed.pcapng.gz\n==683676== \n==683676== Warning: set address range perms: large range [0x59c8b040, 0xd9c8b060) (undefined)\n    1 Note 16:12:06.077788     0.0.6.26 → 8.180.180.180 NFS CB 175 V1 CB_COMPOUND Call <EMPTY> Unknown\n==683676== Warning: set address range perms: large range [0x59c8b028, 0xd9c8b078) (noaccess)\n==683676== \n==683676== HEAP SUMMARY:\n==683676==     in use at exit: 161,312 bytes in 673 blocks\n==683676==   total heap usage: 102,060 allocs, 101,387 frees, 2,220,960,595 bytes allocated\n==683676== \n==683676== LEAK SUMMARY:\n==683676==    definitely lost: 0 bytes in 0 blocks\n==683676==    indirectly lost: 0 bytes in 0 blocks\n==683676==      possibly lost: 0 bytes in 0 blocks\n==683676==    still reachable: 161,312 bytes in 673 blocks\n==683676==         suppressed: 0 bytes in 0 blocks\n==683676== Rerun with --leak-check=full to see details of leaked memory\n==683676== \n==683676== For lists of detected and suppressed errors, rerun with: -s\n==683676== ERROR SUMMARY: 0 errors from 0 contexts (suppressed: 0 from 0)\n```",
